</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A3" title="In Looking to Learn: Token-wise Dynamic Gating for Low-Resource Vision-Language Modelling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C </span>Auxiliary Objective Functions</span></a>
